---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="Avah Xiao">
  <h1>About me</h1>

  <p>
    My name is Avah. I'm an undergraduate computer science student at the <a
      href="https://www.ubc.ca/">University of British Columbia</a
    >. I'm a software lead at <a href="https://www.ubcthunderbots.ca/"
      >Thunderbots</a
    >, UBC's autonomous robot soccer engineering design team that competes at
    the international <a href="https://www.robocup.org/">RoboCup</a> competition.
    I'm also a chair of the hackathon committee in UBC Vancouver's <a
      href="https://www.susubc.ca/">Science Undergraduate Society</a
    >; we organize an annual hackathon, <a
      href="https://hackthecoast.susubc.ca/">Hack the Coast</a
    >.
  </p>

  <p>
    I started programming since I found Khan Academy's <a
      href="https://www.khanacademy.org/hourofcode">Hour of Code</a
    > in elementary school, and it has been the primary focus I put all my time into.
    I went through many phases in my coding journey: competitive programming (<a
      href="https://cemc.uwaterloo.ca/contests/ccc">CCC</a
    >), full-stack web development, game development, attending hackathons,
    teaching code, electronics/firmware, open-source contribution, content
    creation, and now robotics.
  </p>

  <p>
    Aside from computer programming, I'm also a photographer that has done a few
    freelance gigs, but I mostly take photos and put together albums as a hobby.
    My other creative interests include videography, writing blog posts, and
    content creation on YouTube.
  </p>

  <p>
    This is my personal website. I hope for it to act as a place I can direct
    anyone that wants to know more about me, along with somewhere I can upload
    artifacts from my creative hobbies.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
